==Trivia==
* Akachi is a unisex given name of Igbo origin from Nigeria, meaning "the hand of God" or "God's will". It is derived from the Igbo words ''Aka'' (hand) and ''Chi'' (God/spirit), signifying divine protection, guidance, and spiritual blessing.
* Akachi's gender is customized: he has a masculine frame but prefers women's clothing, can neither become pregnant nor get other Sims pregnant, cannot produce milk, and cannot use the toilet standing.

